Subject: Is there an elegant way to set the working directory without providing the whole path each time?
Message-ID: <xGWxgCrsC2A.xiL9IJ4PfswJ@israel-r-user-group.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/israel-r-user-group/c/xGWxgCrsC2A/m/xiL9IJ4PfswJ>
